      "contribution": "Checked Theorems A and B; repaired the ramified-coefficient step; the half-plane calculation and the normalised transfer to characters (Section 5, Corollary E); Theorem C (Section 4); the delay-head example, Proposition D (Section 4); the finite disk lemma, Lemma 2, and Proposition F(i) and F(ii) (Sections 3 and 6); the head-shape route to 3/2 (Section 6.5). Each with an exact certificate.",
